  "_note_grouping": [
    "Three regions, two colours. The shell asks TWO questions, not three:",
    "region 0 and region 2 share 002864 and are merged into one control, so the",
    "server's 400 conflicting_colour is unreachable from this UI by construction.",
    "Submitting expands the colour answer back onto every region_id it covers."
  ],
  "POST /api/assets/a1/answers": {
    "request": {
      "ambiguous_protection": {
        "0": "protect",
        "2": "protect",
        "3": "remove"
      },
      "fade": "artwork"
    },
    "response_200": {
