  "_note_tristate": [
    "`overrides` carries ONLY the rows deliberately taken over. Everything else",
    "is absent so --auto keeps applying its own recommendation. A request that",
    "named all 63 flags would make --auto a no-op and the tool would stop",
    "thinking; that is the failure this shape exists to prevent."
  ],
